sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 用户
    participant REG as PluginRegistry
    participant POL as PermissionHost
    participant W as Isolated Worker
    participant CMD as CommandBus
    User->>REG: 安装 Manifest
    REG->>REG: 验证 schema/id/version/签名策略
    REG-->>User: 显示工具元数据(未加载执行体)
    User->>REG: 点击插件工具
    REG->>POL: 授权核查
    alt 不授权
        POL-->>User: 拒绝并记录
    else 已授权
        REG->>W: 按需启动(受限权限)
        W->>CMD: 提交受控command/patch提案
        CMD->>CMD: 重检范围与版本
        CMD-->>User: 应用事务或报告失败
        REG->>W: 无任务时关闭/可配置闲置策略
    end
